title: The in-conversation crack fires at breaking
story: character-acceptance
author: Sharpee Platform
seed: 42
description: ADR-318 Acceptance 3, crack leg. The bands climb
  monotonically under maintained lies (15/delivery: burdened at 30,
  breaking at 70); the breaking-gated row does not fire below the band
  and fires in conversation the first ask after crossing it.
  Run: node dist/cli/sharpee.js --test
    --story stories/character-acceptance/chord/b3-conscience.story
    stories/character-acceptance/tests/transcripts/b3-breaking-crack.transcript

---

# Below every band, the truth is deflected
> ask steward about the truth
[OK: contains "whatever the books say"]
[OK: not contains "Stop asking"]

# Two maintained lies climb to burdened (15, 30)
> ask steward about the ledger
[OK: contains "balance to the penny"]

> ask steward about the ledger
[OK: contains "balance to the penny"]

# Burdened is not breaking: the crack still does not fire
> ask steward about the truth
[OK: contains "whatever the books say"]
[OK: not contains "Stop asking"]

# Three more maintained lies cross into breaking (45, 60, 75)
> ask steward about the ledger
[OK: contains "balance to the penny"]

> ask steward about the ledger
[OK: contains "balance to the penny"]

> ask steward about the ledger
[OK: contains "balance to the penny"]

# The in-conversation crack fully owns the response (D7 fixed
# 2026-08-16: a hit overrides, never appends — the deflect must not
# trail the crack) — and no model word in the player line
> ask steward about the truth
[OK: contains "Stop. Stop asking. I doctored them"]
[OK: not contains "whatever the books say"]
[OK: not contains "breaking"]
[OK: not contains "band"]
